{"candidateAnswer":"Breathtaking","evidence":"[D17:3 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: My wife and I were road tripping out on the European coastline, and it was amazing! The views were spectacular, and we had lots of fun bonding and creating amazing memories. It was such a nice change to my regular life.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5c3c62e7-f9de-55ff-ad02-fd50d0d7edcc","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:99ee263d8c57dfff76ac81c76abf505a7ee5a6b88f9541092cd16101f51a62fc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did John describe the views during their road trip out on the European coastline?","referenceAnswer":"Spectacular","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"99ee263d8c57dfff76ac81c76abf505a7ee5a6b88f9541092cd16101f51a62fc"}}]}